WEBVTT

00:01.010 --> 00:03.000
Hey, are you listening?!

00:03.660 --> 00:07.440
I told you! The auto-locking 
door was left wide open!

00:07.890 --> 00:09.680
Don't make me repeat myself!

00:10.440 --> 00:12.470
Operating Pro

00:10.440 --> 00:12.470
1) Please
the room you wish to visit.

00:10.440 --> 00:12.470
2) Please
confirm on the display.

00:10.440 --> 00:12.470
3) Please
the room you're visiting.

00:10.830 --> 00:12.470
I told you this last week, too!

00:13.300 --> 00:16.070
Why am I paying such 
high management fees?!

00:16.940 --> 00:18.000
Huh?!

00:18.000 --> 00:19.380
Screw you!

00:19.380 --> 00:20.450
Do it today!

00:20.450 --> 00:22.640
Come inspect it right now!

00:23.480 --> 00:25.290
Are you even listening to me?!

00:25.810 --> 00:27.440
I'll kill you!

01:51.110 --> 01:54.860
